==English==

===Etymology===
Back-formation from ''[[fluorescence]]''

===Verb===
{{en-verb|fluoresc|ing}}

# {{intransitive|physics}} To emit [[electromagnetic radiation]], especially [[visible]] light, when [[absorb]]ing radiation of some other [[wavelength]].
# {{context|intransitive|of colours}} to be very [[bright]], easy to see, [[dayglo]].

